#: data.py:263
msgid "Version 0.2 released"
msgstr "Izdanje 0.2"

#: data.py:264
msgid ""
"It's been just over a month since we released the first version of "
"Clementine. This new version features album cover-art, better \"Various "
"Artists\" detection, support for loading playlists, and much more."
msgstr "Prošlo je jedva mesec dana kako smo objavili prvo izdanje Klementine. Ovo izdanje donosi omote albuma, bolje otkrivanje „Raznih izvođača“, podršku za učitavanje listi numera i još mnogo toga."

#: data.py:270
msgid "Version 0.3 released"
msgstr "Izdanje 0.3"

#: data.py:271
msgid ""
"In this release we've switched to GStreamer on all platforms, meaning the "
"analyzer and crossfading between tracks will now work on Windows. New "
"features include an equalizer, more library grouping options, a nicer OSD, "
"remote control from command-line and MPRIS, and easier tag editing."
msgstr "U ovom izdanju prešli smo na Gstrimer na svim platformama, što znači da sada analizator i pretapanje između numera radi na Vindouzu. Nove mogućnosti su i ekvilajzer, više opcija za grupisanje biblioteke, lepši OSD, daljinska kontrola sa komandne linije i MPRIS, i lakše uređivanje oznaka."

#: data.py:279
msgid "Version 0.4 released"
msgstr "Izdanje 0.4"

#: data.py:280
msgid ""
"This release features tabbed playlists, playlist search, projectM "
"visualisations, Magnatune integration, ReplayGain volume normalisation and "
"music transcoding. We've fixed loads of bugs too - searching large libraries"
" is now much faster, playback is much more reliable on Windows, character "
"encoding problems are fixed, and remote playlists should load correctly all "
"the time."
msgstr "Ovo izdanje donosi liste numera sa jezičcima, pretragu listi numera, projektM vizuelizacije, integraciju u Magnatjun, normalizaciju jačine zvuka i prekodiranje muzike. Takođe smo ispravili mnogo grešaka — pretraga velikih biblioteka je sada mnogo brža, puštanje muzike je mnogo pouzdanije na Vindouzu, problemi sa kodiranjem znakova su ispravljeni i udaljene liste numera bi trebale uvek da se učitaju kako treba."

#: data.py:289
msgid "Version 0.5 released"
msgstr "Izdanje 0.5"

#: data.py:290
msgid ""
"This release adds support for using portable devices with Clementine.  You "
"can now copy songs to your iPod, iPhone, MTP, or USB mass storage device.  "
"See <a href=\"https://github.com/clementine-player/Clementine/wiki/Portable-"
"Devices\">the wiki for more information</a>.  Support for using a <a "
"href=\"https://github.com/clementine-player/Clementine/wiki/Wii-"
"Remotes\">Wii Remote</a> as a remote control has been added.  Other features"
" include a Queue Manager, an Organise Files dialog, automatically stretching"
" columns in the playlist, loading embedded id3v2 cover art, more library "
"scanning options, drag and drop between playlists, and a hypnotoad.  We've "
"also reduced startup time by more than half, fixed a load of memory leaks "
"and reduced CPU usage while playing music. See the <a "
"href=\"https://raw.github.com/clementine-"
"player/Clementine/master/Changelog\">full changelog</a> for more "
"information."
msgstr "Ovo izdanje donosi podršku za korišćenje prenosivih uređaja u Klementini. Sada možete da kopirate pesme na vaš Ajpod, Ajfon, MTP ili USB skladišni uređaj. Pogledajte <a href=\"https://github.com/clementine-player/Clementine/wiki/Portable-Devices\">viki za više informacija</a>.  Dodata je i podrška za korišćenje <a href=\"https://github.com/clementine-player/Clementine/wiki/Wii-Remotes\">Wii daljinskog</a> kao daljinskog upravljača.  Ostali noviteti su menadžer redosleda, dijalog za organizovanje fajlova, automatsko razvlačenje kolona u listi numera, učitavanje ugrađenih id3v2 omota, još opcija za skeniranje biblioteke, prevuci-i-pusti između listi numera i Hipnožabac.  Takođe smo prepolovili vreme pokretanja, ispravili mnoštvo grešaka curenja memorije i smanjili CPU opterećenje tokom puštanja muzike. Pogledajte <a href=\"https://raw.github.com/clementine-player/Clementine/master/Changelog\">ceo dnevnik izmena</a> za više informacija."

#: data.py:306
msgid "Version 0.6 released"
msgstr "Izdanje 0.6"

#: data.py:307
msgid ""
"This release features two new information panes that show lyrics, song "
"statistics, artist biographies, photos and lists of tags and similar "
"artists.  We've redesigned the sidebar (although you can switch back by "
"right clicking on it), and also added ratings, play counts and skip counts."
"  You can create smart and dynamic playlists from songs in your library, and"
" also now listen to music from <a "
"href=\"http://www.jamendo.com/\">Jamendo</a> and Icecast radio stations. See"
" the <a href=\"https://raw.github.com/clementine-"
"player/Clementine/master/Changelog\">full changelog</a> for more "
"information."
msgstr "Ovo izdanje donosi dva nova okna podataka koji prikazuju stihove, statistike pesme, biografije izvođača, fotografije i spisak oznaka i sličnih izvođača. Redizajnirali smo bočnu traku (ali možete da vratite stari dizajn klikom na desni taster miša) i dodali ocene, broj puštanja i broj preskakanja pesme.  Možete da napraviti pametne i dinamičke liste numera od pesama u vašoj biblioteci, i takođe sada možete da slušate muziku sa <a href=\"http://www.jamendo.com/\">Džamendo</a> i Ajskast radio stanica. Pogledajte <a href=\"https://raw.github.com/clementine-player/Clementine/master/Changelog\">ceo dnevnik izmena</a> za više informacija."

#: data.py:319
msgid "Version 0.7 released"
msgstr "Izdanje 0.7"

#: data.py:320
msgid ""
"In this release Clementine gains a brand new edit tag dialog with "
"autocompletion and the ability to automatically identify music and fetch "
"missing tags from MusicBrainz.  CUE sheets are now supported - they are "
"detected automatically when scanning your library and each track will show "
"up separately.  We've made a load of smaller improvements as well such as "
"showing album covers in the Library tab, greying out deleted songs, a \"Show"
" in file browser\" option, support for network proxies, a \"Full library "
"rescan\" option, and a new tooltip for the track slider that helps you seek "
"more accurately to a specific place in a song. See the <a "
"href=\"https://raw.github.com/clementine-"
"player/Clementine/master/Changelog\">full changelog</a> for more "
"information."
msgstr "U ovom izdanju Klementina dobija potpuno novi dijalog za uređivanje oznaka sa automatskim završavanjem i mogućnošću da automatski identifikuje muziku i dobavi nedostajuće oznake sa Mjuzikbrejnz servisa.  CUE listovi su sada podržani — otkrivaju se automatski prilikom skeniranja vaše biblioteke i svaka numera će biti prikazana odvojeno.  Takođe smo napravili mnoštvo manjih poboljšanja kao što je prikaz omota albuma u jezičku biblioteke, označavanje obrisane pesme, opcija „Prikaži u pregledaču fajlova“, podrška za mrežne proksije, opcija „Ponovo skeniraj biblioteku“ i oblačić za klizač numere koji će vam pomoći da preciznije nađete određeni dio pesme. Pogledajte <a href=\"https://raw.github.com/clementine-player/Clementine/master/Changelog\">ceo dnevnik izmena</a> za više informacija."

#: data.py:334
msgid "Version 1.0 released"
msgstr "Izdanje 1.0"

#: data.py:335
msgid ""
"This release adds <a href=\"http://www.spotify.com\">Spotify</a>, <a "
"href=\"http://grooveshark.com\">Grooveshark</a> and <a "
"href=\"http://www.sky.fm/\">SKY.fm</a>/<a "
"href=\"http://www.di.fm/\">Digitally Imported</a> support.  We've also added"
" a Global Search feature that allows you to easily find music that's either "
"in your library or on the Internet. Other features include audio CD support,"
" more transcoder options, an improved settings dialog, smarter album cover "
"searches, and loads of bug fixes. See the <a "
"href=\"https://raw.github.com/clementine-"
"player/Clementine/release-1.0/Changelog\">full changelog</a> for more "
"information."
msgstr "Ovo izdanje donosi podršku za <a href=\"http://www.spotify.com\">Spotifaj</a>, <a href=\"http://grooveshark.com\">Gruvšark</a> i <a href=\"http://www.sky.fm/\">Skaj.fm</a>/<a href=\"http://www.di.fm/\">Didžitali Imported</a>.  Takođe smo dodali mogućnost opšte pretrage koja vam omogućava da lako pronađete muziku koja je ili u vašoj biblioteci ili na internetu. Ostalo uključuje podršku za audio CD-e, više opcija za prekoder, poboljšani dijalog podešavanja, pametnije pretrage omota albuma i mnoštvo ispravki grešaka. Pogledajte <a href=\"https://raw.github.com/clementine-player/Clementine/release-1.0/Changelog\">ceo dnevnik izmena</a> za više informacija."

#: data.py:347
msgid "Version 1.1 released"
msgstr "Izdanje 1.1"

#: data.py:348
msgid ""
"This release adds long-awaited Podcast support including integration and "
"synchronisation with <a href=\"//gpodder.net\">gpodder.net</a>. Music from "
"<a href=\"http://soundcloud.com/\">Soundcloud</a> and <a "
"href=\"http://www.jazzradio.com/\">jazzradio.com</a> is available in the "
"Internet tab in the sidebar, as well as any songs you've uploaded to <a "
"href=\"http://drive.google.com/start\">Google Drive</a>. Clementine will "
"also now show moodbars for the music you play from your local disc. See the "
"<a href=\"https://raw.github.com/clementine-"
"player/Clementine/release-1.1/Changelog\">full changelog</a> for more "
"information."
msgstr "Ovo izdanje donosi dugoočekivanu podršku za Podkast uključujući integraciju i sinhronizaciju sa <a href=\"//gpodder.net\">gpodder.net</a>. Muzika sa <a href=\"http://soundcloud.com/\">Saundklaud</a> i <a href=\"http://www.jazzradio.com/\">jazzradio.com</a> je dostupna u Internet jezičku bočne trake, kao i bilo koje pesme koje ste učitali na <a href=\"http://drive.google.com/start\">Guglov Drajv</a>. Klementina će sada prikazivati trake raspoloženja za muziku koju puštate sa vašeg lokalnog diska.Pogledajte <a href=\"https://raw.github.com/clementine-player/Clementine/release-1.1/Changelog\">ceo dnevnik izmena</a> za više informacija."

#: data.py:361
msgid "Version 1.2 released"
msgstr "Izdanje 1.2"

#: data.py:362
msgid ""
"This release is compatible with the <a "
"href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=de.qspool.clementineremote\">Clementine"
" Remote application for Android</a> which lets you control Clementine "
"remotely from an Android device.<br/>This release also adds support for "
"Subsonic. And you can now listen to your music stored in <a "
"href=\"https://www.box.com/\">Box</a>, <a "
"href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/\">Dropbox</a>, <a "
"href=\"https://skydrive.live.com/\">Skydrive</a> and <a "
"href=\"https://one.ubuntu.com/\">Ubuntu One</a>. Last major new feature is "
"the ability to \"star\" your playlists, so you can safely close them and "
"restore them later from the new \"Playlist\" tab we've added in the left "
"sidebar.<br/>See the <a href=\"https://raw.github.com/clementine-"
"player/Clementine/release-1.2/Changelog\">full changelog</a> for more "
"information."
msgstr "Ovo izdanje je kompatibilno sa <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=de.qspool.clementineremote\">Android aplikacijom Daljinski za Klementinu</a> koja vam omogućava da upravljate Klementinom daljinski sa Android uređaja.<br/>Ovo izdanje takođe donosi podršku za Subsonik. I sada možete da slušate vašu muziku smeštenu na <a href=\"https://www.box.com/\">Boksu</a>, <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/\">Dropboksu</a>, <a href=\"https://skydrive.live.com/\">Skajdrajvu</a> i <a href=\"https://one.ubuntu.com/\">Ubuntu 1</a>. Poslednja bitna novost je mogućnost da označite „zvezdicom“ vaše liste numera, pa ih onda možete slobodno da zatvorite i vratite ih kasnije iz prikaza novog jezička „Lista numera“ kojeg smo dodali u levu bočnu traku.<br/>Pogledajte <a href=\"https://raw.github.com/clementine-player/Clementine/release-1.2/Changelog\">ceo dnevnik izmena</a> za više informacija."

#: data.py:377
msgid "Version 1.3 released"
msgstr "Izdanje 1.3"

#: data.py:378
msgid ""
"This release is compatible with the <a "
"href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=de.qspool.clementineremote\">Clementine"
" Remote application for Android</a> which lets you control Clementine "
"remotely from an Android device.<br/>This release also adds support for "
"accessing your music in Vk.com and Seafile.See the <a "
"href=\"https://raw.github.com/clementine-"
"player/Clementine/release-1.3/Changelog\">full changelog</a> for more "
"information."
msgstr "Ovo izdanje je kompatibilno sa <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=de.qspool.clementineremote\">Android daljinskim za Klementinu</a>, aplikacijom koja vam omogućuje da daljinski upravljate Klementinom sa Android uređaja.<br/>Ovo izdanje takođe donosi podršku za pristup vašoj muzici na Vk.com i Seafile. Pogledajte <a href=\"https://raw.github.com/clementine-player/Clementine/release-1.3/Changelog\">ceo dnevnik izmena</a> za više podataka."

